<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDEN LEAD SOUTH AFRICA 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN LEAD SOUTH AFRICA 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>VAXJO, SWEDEN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden took a 1-0 lead</p>
<p>over South Africa in their Davis Cup tennis World Group, second</p>
<p>round tie after winning the opening singles on Friday:</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Thomas Enqvist beat Grant Stafford 7-5 2-6 6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
